  "type": "mcq",
  "stem": "<p>\\(a(x + 7) = 6x + c\\)</p><p>In the given equation, \\(a\\) and \\(c\\) are constants. If the equation has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of \\(c\\)?</p>",
