  "type": "spr",
  "stem": "<p>The linear function \\(f\\) satisfies \\(f(-2) = 7\\) and \\(f(1) = 4\\). The function \\(g\\) is defined by \\(g(x) = f(x - 3) + 4\\). What is the value of \\(g(8)\\)?</p>",
