  "domain": "algebra",
  "skill": "Linear functions",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "type": "spr",
  "stem": "<p>For the linear function \\(h\\), \\(h(4x) = -4x - 6\\) for all values of \\(x\\). What is the value of \\(h(4)\\)?</p>",
