  "stem": "<p>A freight elevator has a maximum capacity of 1.5 metric tons (1 metric ton = 1,000 kilograms). An operator who weighs 83 kilograms rides in the elevator with crates that each weigh 49 kilograms. What is the maximum number of crates that can be in the elevator with the operator on one trip?</p>",
