  "type": "spr",
  "stem": "<p>A truck can carry a maximum load of 3 tons (1 ton = 2,000 pounds). The truck is already carrying 1,100 pounds of equipment. Each bag of gravel weighs 40 kilograms. If 1 kilogram is equivalent to 2.2 pounds, what is the greatest number of bags of gravel that can be added to the truck?</p>",
