  "stem": "<p>A runner wants to run at least 30 kilometers this week. So far this week she has run 17,100 meters. If each of her remaining runs this week will be 3.5 kilometers long, what is the minimum number of additional runs she must complete to reach her goal? (1 kilometer = 1,000 meters)</p>",
