  "stem": "<p>In the \\(xy\\)-plane, line \\(\\ell\\) passes through the point \\((4, -3)\\) and is perpendicular to the line with equation \\(6x + 2y = -14\\). If line \\(\\ell\\) has \\(y\\)-intercept \\((0, k)\\), what is the value of \\(k\\)?</p>",
