  "skill": "Nonlinear functions",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "type": "mcq",
  "stem": "<p>The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = a(b)^{x}\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are positive constants. The graph of \\(y = f(x)\\) passes through the points \\((1, 45)\\) and \\((3, 1{,}125)\\). What is the value of \\(b\\)?</p>",
